Package: com.nucleartweaks.dynuclear-volume
Name: DynuclearVolume
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: preferenceloader
Maintainer: Spec
Author: Spec
Description: Listens to the room right before a notification or Siri response
 plays and retunes system volume to match: quiet room → your configured
 minimum, loud room → maximum. Separate min/max sliders for notifications
 and Siri. Applies live, no respring.
Section: Tweaks
